  "discovery": "Current Beleren P1.01 and MSE share the same regular n outline and lack n.alt. Card Conjurer fonts/beleren-b.ttf is Beleren2016 Bold1.200, contains n.alt with identical596 advance and bbox25,-95,526,510 versus regular25,0,581,510. Built-in calt includes n before g and at selected word boundaries. Forced fina also substitutes f/h/k/m and must not be enabled globally from one glyph observation.",
